      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Smoketown%2C_Louisville"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The area once housed one of Louisville’s first African‑American public schools, founded in 1874.",
